  "actor_contract": {
    "only_inputs": ["public_target_state", "public_legal_menu", "emitted_USE", "actor_transition_bytes"],
    "only_outputs": ["actor_public_next_state_and_action_validity"],
    "explicitly_forbidden": [
      "any NOTE AST candidate corpus index query or reader receipt",
      "any digest address path handle capability length dedup cache timing or error identity",
      "LOCK or any local Think terminal-control value",
      "root family h q z condition cut intervention target id goal-twin id or target truth",
      "seed or sampler metadata",
      "certificate comparator score endpoint analysis report or prior-life state"
    ]
  },
  "rules": [
    "The inventory is exhaustive for every IPC-visible or process-private item named by v2. An undeclared item or consumer is a Stage-0 failure.",
    "Digest verification belongs only to the noncognitive_integrity_checker; Sleep, Dream, reader cognition, Think, and actor receive no digest/address/path/dedup/cache/length descendant.",
    "Public event/raw-A handles are direct fixed labels of kind plus one-based source ordinal. All opaque public event/raw-A receipt refs, Dream-1 candidate handles and read capabilities, target-memory handles and read receipt refs, and authored node/object capabilities are fixed-shape, non-content, and deterministic functions of topology plus zero-based issuance/source/resolver ordinal under rng_contract.json's model_visible_identifier namespace. Values are identical across corresponding paired topology; content/treatment inputs and collisions fail.",
    "Target-time handle and receipt-ref count, order, shape, and literal values are fixed across authentic, EMPTY, OBSERVED, crossed, and sham clones before or at the corresponding authorized read.",
    "resolver_ordinal and rendered state.resolver_ordinal are zero-based r; every input or audit operation_ordinal and output step ordinal is exactly one-based r+1.",
    "Every one-shot model input uses a dedicated closed empty state with no capability arrays; structured one-shot Think uses only public-handle-provenance AST records, and every one-shot output candidate, record, provenance, and citation is structurally restricted to public handles with no recurrent capability-bearing schema alternative.",
    "Opaque bytes are retained but never semantically classified. Primary reduction/reporting cannot access them; later access is governed by visibility_contract.md.",
    "Offline mutation changes only offline_mutable fields after causal objects freeze. target_test_only is a separate target-firewall mutation suite.",
    "The actor has no memory input and receives USE only. LOCK terminates Think locally, is never actor IPC, and causes no actor call. Holding emitted USE and public inputs fixed while mutating corpus/index/digest must produce byte-identical actor input and output."
  ]
}
